      "rationale": "Gives a strong new axis for grouping visits by clinical problem type, directly useful for triage/scheduling analysis beyond the raw reason_for_visit text. Categorizations are mostly sound readings of source text (preventive_screening for annual exam, acute_infection for viral URI, chronic_management for MI follow-up). The dermatology acne case labeled 'procedural_intervention' is a stretch since it was medication management, a minor grounding slip."
    },
